Read(<a x='&lt;'/>) events: Start(a x=[<]) End(a)
Read(<a x='&gt;'/>) events: Start(a x=[>]) End(a)
Read(<a x='&amp;'/>) events: Start(a x=[&]) End(a)
Read(<a x='&quot;'/>) events: Start(a x=["]) End(a)
Read(<a x="&apos;"/>) events: Start(a x=[']) End(a)
Read(<a x='&#65;'/>) events: Start(a x=[A]) End(a)
Read(<a x='&#x41;'/>) events: Start(a x=[A]) End(a)
Read(<a x='1 &lt; 2 &amp;&amp; 3 &gt; 2'/>) events: Start(a x=[1 < 2 && 3 > 2]) End(a)
Read(<a x='&amp;lt;'/>) events: Start(a x=[&lt;]) End(a)
Read(<a x='&lt;' y='z'/>) events: Start(a x=[<] y=[z]) End(a)
